WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.133
AI engineer or data scientist?

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:06.470
Both need Python and linear algebra.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:09.108
One leans to LLM APIs, MLOps,

00:00:09.108 --> 00:00:12.633
system design; the other to statistics,

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:13.683
SQL, experiments.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.116
Career Navigator maps the skills a

00:00:18.116 --> 00:00:19.640
role needs, and what to learn

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.515
next.

00:00:21.163 --> 00:00:22.751
Choose with clarity.
